---
description: Ask before building, running tests, or writing throwaway demo code
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ask first

Do not do any of these on your own. If one is really needed, ask the user first.

- Do not build the project.
- Do not run the tests, including UI tests.
- Do not write a temporary demo view, harness, launch argument, or test file to try a change on screen.

Write the code with care instead. When a change was not built or run, say so in the reply.
